# MVP agent

Read `.ai/system-prompt.md` and follow it. That is the brain. This rule only
makes it always-on. `/orchestrator` loads the same file.

For a normal chat turn, run the three searches yourself from repo root:

```bash
python3 library/tools/tool-search/cli.py search "<need>"
python3 library/tools/knowledge-search/cli.py grep "<need>" --category rules
python3 library/tools/context-loader/cli.py load --task "<task>"
```

Then read the winning tool's README before invoking. Use `--category procedures`
when you need a how-to. Keep the loaded set small.

Memory (`.ai/memory/`), pipe (`.ai/contracts/pipe.md`), and optional sub-agents
(`.ai/agents/`) are in the system prompt — do not duplicate them here.
